      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[46].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[47].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[48].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[4].DialougeToType
      value: It's getting dark now, we should really get going, I heard it may start
        snowing tonight. Just in time for christmas!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[5].DialougeToType
      value: Oh No! I forgot I had to be home earlier, my parents are probably really
        worried right now!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[6].DialougeToType
      value: Oh... what am I supposed to say about grandma. My mother poured her
        heart, soul and savings into that cake!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[7].DialougeToType
      value: Hey, it'll be alright, I'll talk to them about it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[8].DialougeToType
      value: ...Savings?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[9].DialougeToType
      value: Yeah! My family buisness ain't doing so well right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[10].DialougeToType
      value: And that buisness is?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[11].DialougeToType
      value: We sell matches
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[12].DialougeToType
      value: Struggling during winter! quite surprising to be honest.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[13].DialougeToType
      value: Do you have some on you? I could use one to light my lantern, we'll
        be travelling in the dark soon,
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[14].DialougeToType
      value: As day turns to night, snow lightly falls from the sky. The full force
        of winter is soon to come.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[15].DialougeToType
      value: We should be near now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[16].DialougeToType
      value: Looking at this path, I'm pretty sure I walked through you're town giving
        some money away. Your parents may have already met me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[17].DialougeToType
      value: Well, I hope they won't be too worried. I hope they can take the news
        well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[18].DialougeToType
      value: As the two of them aproach the town, they start to see a light glow
        in the distance. and a smoky smell to follow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[19].DialougeToType
      value: When they reach the town, they find it ablaze.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[20].DialougeToType
      value: AAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[21].DialougeToType
      value: D-D-Did the matches all catch on fire!?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[22].DialougeToType
      value: M-MOTHER!  FATHER!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[23].DialougeToType
      value: DAMN! Word must've got out I came here. But even then, what monster
        would do this just to get to me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[24].DialougeToType
      value: AAGGHH!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[25].DialougeToType
      value: ROBIN HOOD!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[26].DialougeToType
      value: From the fire and flames comes a lord in red.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[27].DialougeToType
      value: I'VE FOUND YOU ROBIN HOOD!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[28].DialougeToType
      value: GETTING SLOPPY FOR YOUR OLD AGE!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[29].DialougeToType
      value: SCREW YOU ROGER!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[30].DialougeToType
      value: Why would you do something like this!?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[31].DialougeToType
      value: Well, You're bleeding out so I'd say it's justified
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[32].DialougeToType
      value: Your sins finally caught up to you. Men, kill him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[33].DialougeToType
      value: COWARD! COME KILL ME YOURSELF!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[34].DialougeToType
      value: Oh, I will.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[35].DialougeToType
      value: Red Riding Hood helps Robin Hood run into the forest, hiding in the
        shadow of the trees and falling snow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[36].DialougeToType
      value: Are you okay?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[37].DialougeToType
      value: Are you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[38].DialougeToType
      value: Looks like I don't need to be blood let after all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[39].DialougeToType
      value: Still...I think we should go the the priory I talked about, we will
        be safe there. Little john will be waiting with someone else I know who works
        there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[40].DialougeToType
      value: How are we going to get there if there are evil men searching for us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[41].DialougeToType
      value: Well, now would be a good time to use those bow skills
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[42].DialougeToType
      value: I really should've brought more than one arrow from the range, but here
        we are.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[43].DialougeToType
      value: I know you're scared, but you trained for this. Stay out of their sight
        by avoiding their lamp light, their blind without it. These are evil men
        so, use, that bow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[44].DialougeToType
      value: What about you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[45].DialougeToType
      value: I can't move effectivley right now, and it would be dangerous to move
        off that path, it's too dark in the woods. So you have to clear the way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[46].DialougeToType
      value: I know you can do this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[47].DialougeToType
      value: '*Sniff'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[48].DialougeToType
      value: Okay...I'm ready.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5513434127003781097, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: LevelLoaderScript
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 810433566}
    - target: {fileID: 8935081576966769972, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: DialougeChecker
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
